# WarriorCastEnchant1Of4 (22009, level 31, four self buffs 4089 to 4092): its creation draws which
# buff it keeps (2: the third, SELF_BUFF3 4091). The first hit by the character, on a draw under 33 and
# above half of its hit points, wants that buff on itself; a second hit does not, and IntAI1 counts
# the chance spent.
